<title>USA: Ladysmith, Wis., won by Banc One Capital.</title>
<headline>Ladysmith, Wis., won by Banc One Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banc One Capital said it won $1.225 million of Ladysmith, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.02 percent.</p>
</text>
